  "title": "Amazingly Good Eggnog",
  "description": "This amazingly good eggnog recipe is thickened with egg yolks, flavored with warm spices, and a splash of rum for a creamy, festive adult beverage.",
  "authors": [
    "NATALIESMOM"
  ],
